   "title": "Naa Seidu Tungbani Salinbille II outdoored as Dorimon chief after four-year dispute",
   "url": "https://www.myjoyonline.com/naa-seidu-tungbani-salinbille-ii-outdoored-as-dorimon-chief-after-four-year-dispute/",
