   "title": "Bihar’s Ranivas Mound declared monument of national importance",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/bihar/bihars-ranivas-mound-declared-monument-of-national-importance/article71679038.ece",
   "domain": "thehindu.com",
