   "title": "Gyanesh Kumar will soon be forced to step down, says K.C. Venugopal",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/kerala/gyanesh-kumar-will-soon-be-forced-to-step-down-says-kc-venugopal/article71678914.ece",
