   "title": "Nasarawa APC crisis: Govt calls for probe of rally disruption",
   "url": "https://www.vanguardngr.com/2026/11/nasarawa-apc-crisis-govt-calls-for-probe-of-rally-disruption/",
   "domain": "vanguardngr.com",
